# Large, fully regenerable artefacts. Rebuild any of these with ./build.sh
#
#   output/png/                  300 dpi RGB rasters   (~13 MB each)
#   output/print-ready/cmyk-tiff 300 dpi CMYK rasters  (~28 MB each)
#   output/pdf/                  Chromium intermediates; print-ready/rgb is the
#                                same artwork with trim/bleed boxes applied
#   output/review/               working crops from design review
#   assets/background.png        intermediate; background.jpg is the one used
output/png/
output/pdf/
output/print-ready/cmyk-tiff/
output/review/
assets/background.png

# toolchain
node_modules

# 300 dpi lossless rasters: ~12 MB each, regenerate with
#   python3 src/make_images.py --with-png
output/images/png-300dpi/
